### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@roomId = 1
@sensorId = 1
@csrfToken = replace-with-xsrf-cookie-value

### Get all sensors
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sensors

### Get sensors by room
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sensors?roomId={{roomId}}

### Search sensors by name
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sensors?search=temperature

### Search sensors by room and name
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sensors?roomId={{roomId}}&search=temperature

### Get sensor by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sensors/{{sensorId}}

### Create sensor
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sensors
Content-Type: application/json
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "roomId": {{roomId}},
  "name": "Room Temperature Sensor",
  "type": "TEMPERATURE",
  "unit": "°C"
}

### Update sensor
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/sensors/{{sensorId}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "name": "Main Temperature Sensor",
  "unit": "°C"
}

### Update safe range
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/sensors/{{sensorId}}/safe-range
Content-Type: application/json
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "minSafeValue": 18.0,
  "maxSafeValue": 25.0
}

### Deactivate sensor
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sensors/{{sensorId}}/deactivate
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

### Activate sensor
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sensors/{{sensorId}}/activate
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

### Validation error: invalid safe range
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/sensors/{{sensorId}}/safe-range
Content-Type: application/json
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "minSafeValue": 30.0,
  "maxSafeValue": 20.0
}

### Not found error
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sensors/999999
